{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LtQzJGNE5RqzrTnJ4M82Q3","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 faith-evidence-ie 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (76 个)\\n\\n- **mvp2_sft_eval_r2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp2_sft_eval**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r2**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_extract_r2**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_ced_r4**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_extract**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_flatnli**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_ced_r3**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_ced_r2**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_ced_r1**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_ced**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **precompute_nli_train**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp2_sft_warmup**: DONE (success) — \\n- **smoke_test_grpo**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp1_ced_signal**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-15\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| plan_011_grpo_g8_bf16 | GRPO G=8 bf16 LoRA: 验证 catastrophic forgetting 是否在 bf16（非 QLoRA 4-bit）下仍复现。CED reward + kl_coef=0.01, 100 steps。如仍 fail → 加强 Claim 3 | — | — | — |\\n| mvp2_eval_rsft_r2b_maxtok1536_r2 | Truncation diagnosis: r2b eval with max_new_tokens=1536 (vs default 1024). Retry with correct model stack (Base+SFT+RSFT). If EDCR improves significantly (from 0.6609 toward 0.71+), truncation is the cause. If unchanged, distractor citation is genuine RSFT behavior. | — | — | — |\\n| mvp2_ced_reranker_poc | CED-as-reranker: no fine-tuning, use CED to select best of N=8 SFT candidates at inference time. If rel_f1 > 0.4057 (SFT greedy), CED adds value without training risk. Oracle reranker as upper bound. | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- plan_004_dreeam_baseline: Phase A: 复现 DREEAM fully-supervised teacher (RoBERTa-large) DocRED dev Evi-F1≈54.15, RE-F1≈63.49。论文报告的57.34是student model在test set的结果，需4阶段self-training pipeline。（排队等待 GPU）\\n- mvp2_eval_rsft_s44: Full dev eval of RSFT seed=44 checkpoint. First MVP-2 judgement data point. Pass: rel_f1 > 0.4057 AND evi_f1 > 0.798 (SFT baseline).（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **mvp2_eval_rsft_s43_r2** (success): Full dev eval of RSFT s43 (seed=43). 3rd seed for variance estimation. r1: rel_f1=0.4449, s44: rel_f1=0.4655. Pass: rel_f1 > 0.4057, evi_f1 > 0.798. Retry of mvp2_eval_rsft_s43 (fixed arg names). ← 基于 mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s43\\n- **mvp2_rsft_ced_scoring_topk3_r2** (success): CED scoring ablation: top_k=3 (vs top_k=1). More training data (~8000 samples) vs stricter selection (2718 samples). Retry with HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1 (NLI model cached locally). ← 基于 mvp2_rsft_ced_scoring\\n- **mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s44** (success): RSFT training seed=44 variance estimate. Same params as r1 (bf16 LoRA r=64/α=128, lr=2e-5, 3 epochs, weighted sampling, CED-filtered 2718 samples). Pass: rel_f1 > 0.4057 AND evi_f1 > 0.798. ← 基于 mvp2_rsft_train_r1\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 26 / 负向 11 / 失败 12 / 共 71\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nrtx5090-4x: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\n\\n## 告警\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_flatnli: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_extract: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_sft_eval: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_r4: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_extract_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r3: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_kl001: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_kl001_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_kl001_r3: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r4: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_extract_r4: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r5: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_multi: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_last: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_ckpt90: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_high: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_lr5e6_r1: 已被终止 — u\\n\\n## 研究想法\\n# Idea Inbox\\n\\n## 待验证\\n\\n- [2026-05-14] **GRPO 遗忘缓解方案 A**：增大 KL 系数（0.001→0.04）+ 扩大 LoRA rank（r=4→r=16）+ 降低 lr 至 1e-6。文献调研表明 GRPO+QLoRA 低秩+低KL 是已知不稳定组合，这是最低成本的修复。\\n- [2026-05-14] **GRPO 遗忘缓解方案 B**：分层 Reward 设计——将单一 reward 分解为 format_reward + entity_reward + relation_reward，消除 reward hacking 捷径。参考 RL-Struct (arXiv 2512.00319) 的层级约束方法。\\n- [2026-05-14] **GRPO 遗忘缓解方案 C**：集成 Qwen 团队的 Online Merging Optimizer (arXiv 2405.17931)，在 GRPO 每步将 LoRA 更新方向锚定在 SFT 附近，训练中在线缓解 alignment tax。\\n## ACTIVE\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_017XUvHc5e6t6kh5rX6uQ2MT","session_id":"ef33cb85-ae55-46f6-8462-dd61be87818f","uuid":"49607ab2-e3e7-42e4-8ed6-1043cd527c09","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:19:25.521Z"}
