{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":563889,"duration_api_ms":710174,"num_turns":15,"result":"Review submitted.\n\n**Consolidated score: 2.5/5 — Leaning Reject for EMNLP 2026 Main; recommend Findings track.**\n\nKey findings from the 2-reviewer roundtable:\n\n- **Task contribution is credible**: first LLM-based DocRE with evidence generation, well-scoped claim\n- **Best empirical contribution**: evidence-extraction decoupling under GRPO+QLoRA, with compelling G=4 vs G=8 evidence\n- **Three major weaknesses dragged the score**: (1) CED doesn't significantly beat flat-NLI (p>0.05), limiting method novelty; (2) GRPO decoupling confounded by QLoRA — no full-FT control; (3) substantial related work gaps (no RL-for-IE citations, missing recent LLM DocRE baselines)\n- **Comprehensive experiments** (13/13 planned experiments covered) and honest reporting were consistently praised\n- **Path to acceptance**: run GRPO without QLoRA, expand related work, reframe CED honestly, report multi-seed statistics\n\nReport saved to `dream_reports/dream_20260515T132059/median/review_report.md`.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"ef33cb85-ae55-46f6-8462-dd61be87818f","total_cost_usd":3.0310987500000004,"usage":{"input_tokens":13,"cache_creation_input_tokens":81184,"cache_read_input_tokens":465560,"output_tokens":14529,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":81184,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":285,"cache_read_input_tokens":84495,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8530,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8530},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":90515,"outputTokens":2391,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":6,"costUSD":0.16246999999999998